  "releaseNotes": "1.5.0 — Schema v3.1 + PHP/Markdown embedded language injection: PHP-in-HTML (.whfmt embeddedLanguages[] + runtime EmbeddedRangeClassifier); Markdown fenced code blocks (```lang) supported as first-class embedded zones; CSS.whfmt broken Type pattern fixed; whfmt.FileFormatCatalog used by WPFHexaEditor 3.4.0 entropy heatmap. Updated companion packages (whfmt.Analysis 1.1.2, whfmt.CodeGen 1.1.5, whfmt.Fuzz 1.1.2, whfmt.Validate 1.0.2) all reference 1.5.0. 1.4.1 — Schema v3.1: embeddedLanguages[] in syntaxDefinition; HTML.whfmt with JS+CSS zones. 1.4.0 — 856 definitions (+57); .whfmt as AdditionalFiles for whfmt.SourceGenerator. 1.3.2 — whfmt v3 GA; expression engine; 8 new formats; companion NuGets public.",
